  "releaseNotes": "TRIAL EDITION - SQL longer than 10,000 characters is rejected (parse() returns -1). Full edition: https://www.sqlparser.com\n\nRelease 4.1.0.20\n\n- [dlineage] A qualified column name whose qualifier names no table in\n  scope, such as an Oracle package constant pkg.c compared in a\n  single-table query, no longer becomes a column of that table or a\n  self-loop in INSERT ... VALUES. Plain TGSqlParser.parse() binding is\n  unchanged.\n\nDemos: https://github.com/sqlparser/gsp_demo_dotnet",
